WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:35.020
By the way, have you gotten any updates on Raginei from Carl?

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:40.530
Apparently there was a massive crack-down on anti-government forces at the beginning of this month.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:46.420
It's practically a Reign of Terror. No one in the palace has realized how bad things are...

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:51.390
or else somebody is making sure they don't...

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.540
That "somebody" is who Eugene's going there to see...

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:57.280
...via his sister-in-law's connections.

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:59.540
Kajika hasn't been much trouble?

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:02.730
She's arriving in Singapore tomorrow.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.610
To join His Highness Rumaty?

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.230
Yes.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.590
I forbade her coming, but it was useless.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.030
I'm sure.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.410
Well, goodbye for now.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.020
<i>Only this far, though.</i>

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.270
<i>I won't let Kajika go any further.</i>

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.840
<i>Because at any moment, a civil war could erupt in Raginei.</i>

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:30.220
"Puppet"

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:36.740
I'm home, Xiao-Ying.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.920
My, my, my!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.200
Oh, do let me get a good look at you...

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:44.750
Ah, but you've gotten so thin...

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:45.930
You think so?

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:50.260
Only my cooking will do for you, Master Lee-Leng, that's why.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.870
This young man is His Highness Rumaty.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:57.230
Pleased to meet you. This is my chamberlain, Sezun.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.390
Please excuse me... welcome, Your Highness.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:03.990
Please, no formalities.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:06.920
I've heard you make exquisite cinnamon rolls.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.960
If you wouldn't mind, I'd love to try one.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:14.150
Master Lee-Leng...

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.470
Coming right up.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:18.890
By the way, where is Kajika?

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:23.260
They left to pick her up some time ago, so she should be arriving soon.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.680
Miss Kajika, please! Wait a minute!

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.920
I can worry about my bags and stuff later!

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:35.780
I wondered what Lee-Leng's childhood home would be like...

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:38.200
...it's very peaceful.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:43.260
Perhaps I can soak up that peace... for a few days.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:46.260
Rumaty...

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:58.300
- My goodness, is that so?
- Hah hah... yes, exactly.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.500
I'm stuck.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:07.600
I can't even get in the room without an invitation from the King.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.360
Security is tighter than I'd imagined.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.420
Eugene!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.640
Th--that shrill voice!

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:20.730
You! I know that's you, Eugene De Volkan!

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.240
<i>Pervert King... No... His Highness...</i>

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.730
Ah, Your Highness Izmal.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:28.210
Hmph! You have some nerve!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.370
How nice of you to show up!

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:35.950
Did you forget? How you broke your promise to visit my palace?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:42.760
That's a point I would like to discuss with you further... How about tomorrow?

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.620
I'll visit tomorrow.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:47.540
Make sure you come!

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.400
You didn't even show up to apologize!

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:55.220
I never want to see your stupid rude face again!

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:03.100
<i>Ugh... even Izmal is still royalty, I suppose...</i>

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:04.510
<i>Time to switch modes...</i>

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.220
Indeed. You'll never have to see me again.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:09.840
Whu--huh?

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:12.360
My failure to keep my promise to Your Highness...

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:17.260
I never got a chance to apologize, and it has worried me all this time.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:21.630
Even today, my only fear was that I might meet with Your Highness.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:23.810
Fear?

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:26.790
You were frightened of having me scold you?

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.640
I was. But now, being reprimanded like this...

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:33.670
I feel as if a heavy weight has finally been lifted from my heart.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.870
Eugene...

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:39.820
Alright!

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:43.450
Tonight, let's spend the whole night talking at my palace!

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.130
<i>It worked...</i>

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:46.630
<i>A little </i>too <i>well</i>...

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.590
Ooh, your hand is as soft as ever...

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.460
How can any man have so much beauty?

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.370
Izmal, you're making a spectacle of yourself.

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:02.050
Najayra...

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:07.550
Eugene has a prior engagement with me...

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.630
Don't you?

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.360
So you're after Somand?

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.860
You're here to see him, right? And if you can, you want to sweet-talk him into your pocket along with Izmal. Right?

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:24.070
You have me at a loss.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.290
Just one problem: he's not here.

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:31.070
He absolutely never leaves the Royal Palace.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:34.380
All his public appearances are made by body doubles.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:36.800
Body doubles...

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.320
So meeting him will be next to impossible.

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:42.500
It's entirely hopeless, unless...

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.500
someone close to the royal family can get you into the Palace.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:50.020
Incidentally, I'm leaving for the Royal Palace soon.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.630
Care to join me?

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:55.240
What are you after?

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:57.760
I told you before.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.940
I just don't want to be bored.

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:09.390
<i>She's changed.  She's not the same girl she was a year ago.</i>

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.180
What do you say?

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.420
<i>I don't know what she's scheming at...</i>

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:17.640
<i>but whatever it is, it's my chance.</i>

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.570
"Interference in Domestic Affairs?"

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.940
Yes. It looks like the U.S. is stepping in to mediate...

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:32.320
but it says Raginei regards even the U.N. observation as "foreign interference in domestic affairs," and won't accept it.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:37.390
But, my goodness... Raginei is isolating itself from the international community.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:41.530
Yes... and then of course, the resistance from the faction opposing the King will grow stronger.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.730
If we don't act, it will inevitably come to a civil war.

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.740
What should we do?

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:50.100
I think... the first step is getting the military on our side.

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:53.830
Army, Navy, Air Force, and then Imperial Guard.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.180
If the Armed Forces are active...

00:07:56.430 --> 00:08:00.360
...it'll be much tougher going for anyone plotting civil war.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.680
Sezun, do you know Naval Viceroy Rojas?

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:10.620
Yes. A level-headed man, the Viceroy, with connections in the Air Force, as well...

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.730
If we could win him over, it would really help.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:15.980
But, how?

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:18.230
With your permission, Your Highness, I'll go.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.860
You, Sezun? You mean you're going to sneak across the border?

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.850
I've met some of 2nd Lt. Noei's friends before.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:28.130
If I can get in touch with the Imperial Guard Corps, I should be able to manage.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.190
Unfortunately...

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.110
You're crazy.

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:38.550
Sezun, if you went, you'd be suspected of spying for the King's faction--and killed.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.970
I--it's you...

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.350
Isaac!

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:48.740
Your Highness. I'm glad to find you safe.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:52.630
You almost gave me a heart attack, showing up out of nowhere like that.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.530
Hah, sorry.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:57.180
But how did you know His Highness Rumaty was here?

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:00.750
There's a large population of Raginei nationals living in Singapore.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:06.420
Some of them are on our side, and know their way around the interior of the country.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.700
They'll disguise themselves as workers commuting in and out...

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:14.030
...but they said they'd be checking all the faces coming in...

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:17.320
Let's just focus on having a good practice run.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:20.020
From now on, make sure everything goes without a hitch.

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.270
Please excuse me.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.070
And now? How is Raginei?

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:28.690
Word of Rumaty's return has spread across the country...

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.680
...and expectations are high.  Truly...

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:35.250
...His Highness is the only person who can stop what's happening right now.

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:40.310
He's always had tremendous popularity among the people. It's only natural.

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:44.030
Not only that the Somand faction has fought fiercely.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:47.040
Not only that.

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:51.560
The army faction led by Sabaji is rallying for the King to be dethroned.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.810
He is against King Rumaty returning.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:59.900
The Army? 
 Things are getting worse.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:03.150
So there are three powers fighting?

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:07.040
The Somand faction.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.730
The Rumaty faction.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.270
And ones that call for an abolition to the kingship...

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.140
...wanting a republic, the anti-king faction.

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:19.560
It is like a three-way tar pit.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:25.670
How unfortunate. 
 I know they all want their country to prosper.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:31.500
It's useless talking to my brother.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.890
There's no time to waste.
 Let's think of a new plan!

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.280
- Rumaty.
- Your Highness.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:42.940
We must first stop Sabaji.

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:47.590
Noei, who else holds power in the army?

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.660
Yes, I know a few.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.740
<i>I couldn't have imagined this from him a year ago.</i>

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:59.280
We need to split the army, so that power doesn't concentrate with Sabaji.

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:04.090
- Can you do this for me?
- <i>He thinks like a leader already.</i>

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:07.980
- Leave it to me.
- I will go too!

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:10.240
Sezun?!
 What are you saying?

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:13.360
I am more fit to the palace than the Lieutenant.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:17.560
Within the palace there are people that are against the current conditions.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.050
- But... 
- You're right.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:24.380
If people within the palace can support us, I will be more confident.

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:26.800
But...

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:29.320
...Don't get near Quinza.

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:33.270
Don't try to find out his intentions.

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:37.280
- But, why... 
- Understand me Sezun?

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:39.990
Lee-Leng.

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.680
Lee-Leng...

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:50.340
...are you doubting Quinza?

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:55.850
Quinza has been working in the palace since Rumaty was young.

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.800
- How could he betray Rumaty.
- He's not betraying him.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:04.300
What Quinza is aiming for is the same as Noei.

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:06.240
He wants Rumaty to become king.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.690
What? But why...

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:11.400
The goal is the same, but the method is different.

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:16.340
Quinza is intentionally oppressing the people, so that the people would...

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.270
...bring about a revolution.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:24.270
Then he is going to clean out the palace and King Somand...

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:28.220
- ...and make a way for Rumaty to sit on the throne.
- No way...

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:34.750
...that's not right! 
 Why would he intentionally bring unrest?

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:39.080
That's right. 
 That's why we can't cooperate with Quinza.

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:42.170
You can't convince him? Even if Rumaty tells him?

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:45.610
There's no way. He's very sharp.

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:49.560
He understands what he is doing...

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:53.610
...thinking it is for his Lord.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.280
Quinza's will is strong.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:01.060
Quinza is one of our fierce opponents.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:09.690
- May I get dinner ready?
- Please do so.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:14.600
You should go change. 
 You look uncomfortable.

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.860
I'm going to go to Raginei.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.890
I'm going to go see Quinza!

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:27.280
- He will meet up with me, right?
- No, you can't go.

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:32.370
- Don't get near that country!
- Why...? - You can't!

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:38.770
- Lee-Leng?! 
- Raginei is on the verge of a civil war!

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:44.060
- You might be captured! 
- I can't leave them alone!

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:48.140
No! Don't go! I forbid you!

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:57.280
I can't believe him. I'm not doing this out of selfish ambition.

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:03.680
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:18.940
- Are you afraid of heights?
- No.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:28.660
<i>She's changed --- She's gotten so mature.</i>

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:32.420
You can see it now.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:41.690
Everything except for the First Temple was...

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.540
...built with oil wealth.

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:48.660
I call it the "Oil Palace."

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:52.070
I named it. Don't you think it's a perfect name?

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:08.220
Your Highness Rumaty.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:18.480
<i>"I will return. I don't care if it's only one...</i>

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:24.050
<i>...If a voice among my people asks for me nothing will stop me. I will...</i>

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.560
<i>...return."</i>

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.810
We're almost there. Just hang on.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.940
The true king chosen by Ragi...

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.860
...blessed by the sun, the true king.

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:48.640
I don't want you to witness this deteriorating palace.

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:54.510
I don't want the "maggots" to have their feelings hurt.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:59.980
I will prepare the palace for you to reign in power.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.750
I will.

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:16.040
Your Highness, Najayra. Welcome.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.750
His Majesty awaits you.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:24.860
- Quinza.
- It's going to take him a while to come out, right?

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:29.580
Don't worry; I will be with you while you wait.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:34.200
- Don't bore me. 
- Oh no, I'm scared.

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:42.000
<i>Where have Najayra's manners gone?</i>

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.450
Come on Eugene.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:49.100
I will guide you to His Majesty.

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.440
- I will take it from here.
- Yes.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:10.190
Think of something to talk about so we can pass the time.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:15.060
It might take - - - half a day. Maybe even a few days.

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:20.190
- You must have some patience.
- Yes.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:23.600
But Her Highness, Najayra, will wait.

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.330
For her beloved King Somand.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:36.570
Of course, because you will help me pass the time.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.520
<i>What?! What is happening?!</i>

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:45.550
Well, well, Najayra...

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.160
...not in front of the guest.

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:51.310
<i>What is going on here?</i>

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.660
Anyway, I would like to introduce her...

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:59.600
Najayra Isa Chadli, she is the future queen of Raginei.

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:03.320
...the future wife of King Somand.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:08.200
- What?!
- And she is my beloved.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.620
<i>You scum.</i>

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.130
Your Highness.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:21.580
You mentioned that you will be with someone that will entertain you.

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:27.410
- Is he going to be able to fulfill that?
- Yes. God has led me to him.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:31.290
He will never leave me bored.

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:35.370
Are you wanting to sit on the throne just for fun?

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:39.890
Maybe. I'm still not interested in the throne.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.730
But, I was told I need it to enjoy my life.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.630
Her Highness is fit to become the queen.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:51.870
She is my Lord, and also the woman I love.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.690
Even if she betrays King Somand, I will not regret it.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:58.780
I will go to hell by myself.

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:02.730
Yes, please do so.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:07.960
Your Highness, I would like to speak alone with Quinza.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:11.710
How brave. You're going to push me out?

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:17.770
- Oh well, go ahead. I'm in a good mood today.
- Excuse me.

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:30.760
I am wowed by this.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.560
What are you going to do using Najayra?

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.210
Use? She's just a little girl.

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:44.650
If she can't truly understand the message from God...

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:46.910
...she is useless!

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.470
I'm sorry.

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:58.000
As a token of my apology. Don't worry...

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:04.590
...it doesn't have poison. I can get rid of you in other ways.

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:09.020
- Me?
- For instance...

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:12.400
If I bring your belongings from the hotel...

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:15.840
...it can be said that you came here on your own.

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:24.660
Najayra dislikes Kajika.

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:27.780
If I don't take something precious from Kajika...

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:32.050
...I can't keep her very happy.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:37.150
- Are you trying to kill me? 
 - I'm not a hitman.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:40.330
I won't take a part in something unnecessary.

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:45.430
All I want you to do is stay here for a few days.

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:52.090
- Just enough so Kajika will be worried.
- Is that why you have me here?

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:55.140
You must have sensed something.

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:03.110
How dare you.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:07.440
- You. 
- Be careful...

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:12.000
I won't hesitate to kill you.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:20.660
Not just you. For this country I will kill hundreds, even thousands.

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:27.220
- <i>You...</i>
- To kill for the country is not murder.

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:32.540
It will just be considered a sacrifice.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:37.420
<i>Is he the devil?</i>

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.310
Kajika---

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:56.240
The former King of Raginei's...

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:59.330
...first son Harry's daughter, Kajika.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:04.460
She is the true heir to the throne.

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:12.740
What would Quinza do if he realizes that fact.

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:15.100
It is obvious what he would do.

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:19.370
Even if I tell her the truth about her lineage...

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:22.270
...she would not give up going to Raginei.

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:25.160
Actually...

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:32.650
Why is it that I can't stay put when I think about Raginei.

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:47.720
Is it because it's just like Givoli Island? 
 Or am I worried about Rumaty?

00:22:48.770 --> 00:22:51.060
I don't understand but...

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:55.170
...I can't stay put thinking about that country.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.060
My heart is racing...

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:44.750 --> 00:24:14.530
Next Week

00:23:44.750 --> 00:24:14.530
"Heavy Chains"

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
